winemac: Add opt-in aggregate flush/swap wall-time profiling.

CYDER_GL_PROFILE=1 enables per-context counters and timing. Disabled by default;
no per-call allocation, locking, clock reads or log I/O when disabled. Report
at most two aggregate lines per context per five seconds, plus context destroy.
Keep native flush, A6 synchronization and visible-surface presentation unchanged.
Durations include driver waits, not GPU execution time. No game-specific policy.

